    "body": "Record the explicit iPhone Safari PASS for the already-merged Stage 7.12 first-real-battle aftermath slice.\n\n- accepted runtime remains PR #301 at `4e27aa0d690127c7b495c9c690026f7bf58c621a`\n- record branch-aware NPC-memory aftermath, non-blocking reaction, refresh persistence, exactly-once acknowledgement, no replay and ordinary-battle isolation as user-accepted\n- synchronize `TASKS.md`, `PROJECT_MEMORY.md`, `.ai-memory/CURRENT.md`, `.ai-memory/CANON.md`, and `.ai-memory/WORKFLOWS.md`\n- set memory revision to `2026-08-06-2101-JST`\n- clear the active runtime task\n- select no later runtime slice\n- set exact next action to `AWAIT_EXPLICIT_USER_DIRECTION_FOR_NEXT_STAGE7_PRODUCT_SLICE`\n\nValidation:\n- memory-sync workflow `31100332051` PASS\n- exact final five-file scope against `main`\n- branch is `behind_by 0`\n- manual readback confirms accepted SHA, user verdict, no active runtime task, unique canonical next action and preserved historical entries\n- runtime, `docs`, source mirrors and protected mechanics are untouched\n\nForensic note: earlier temporary runs failed closed on ambiguous historical revision anchors and on the temporary patcher appearing in the diff. The final successful run updates only the active current anchors and restores the patcher before exact-scope validation; both temporary files were removed before this PR.",
